.subckt SCR_REAL A G K
* Standard Two-Transistor Latch with realistic thresholds
* A=Anode, G=Gate, K=Cathode
Qpnp A n1 K Qpmod
Qnpn n1 G K Qnmod
* Internal Gate-Cathode resistor defines Igt (Gate Trigger Current)
Rg G K 1k 
* Internal Anode-Base resistor improves stability/dv/dt
Rs n1 A 10k
.model Qpmod PNP(BF=20 IS=1e-12 VCEO=100)
.model Qnmod NPN(BF=100 IS=1e-12 VCEO=100)
.ends SCR_REAL